  },
  "body": "This pull request includes minor changes to the `RenameWidget` and `RenameCandidateListView` classes in the `src/vs/editor/contrib/rename/browser/renameWidget.ts` file. The changes focus on refactoring event handling to use event emitters instead of direct function calls. As suggested by  @ulugbekna in his FIXME comment \r\n\r\nRefactoring event handling:\r\n\r\n* `RenameWidget`: Removed inline event handler functions for focus and selection changes from the `RenameCandidateListView` constructor, and added them as disposables separately.  \r\n* Replaced direct function calls for `onFocusChange` and `onSelectionChange` with event emitters `_onFocusChange` and `_onSelectionChange`. ",
  "rebaseable": true
 },
 "files": [
  {
